Interchange StaffAssociation
    documentation 'This interchange defines staff and teacher information. It can be used to define 
                  'employment, assignment, and teaching associations, as well as staff positions 
                  'and staff leave events.
    element Staff
    element StaffEducationOrganizationEmploymentAssociation
    element StaffEducationOrganizationAssignmentAssociation
    element StaffSchoolAssociation
    element StaffSectionAssociation
    element LeaveEvent
    element OpenStaffPosition
    element StaffProgramAssociation